<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The Admin Console is a batch command runner. Open it from File > Admin > Console; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_features", "Input format")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Each line is a slash command, for example")}
  <code>{dgettext("help_features", "/admin server info")}</code>{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    ". Lines starting with"
  )}
  <code>#</code>
  {dgettext("help_features", "are comments and are skipped, as are empty lines.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Why use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Everything the other admin windows do with forms can be done here as a script. That makes it the tool for provisioning a server in one pass, or for anything the focused windows do not expose."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_checkmark}>{dgettext("help_features", "Example script")}</.help_h4>
<pre><code>{dgettext("help_features", "# Inspect server state /admin server info /admin channel list /admin cs info #general /setmotd Welcome to RetroHexChat!")}</code></pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Access")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Only server administrators and server operators can open it. The console runs under a privileged context that forces admin rights and lifts the per-user channel limit, so that gate is the only thing between a caller and privileged execution."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-users">{dgettext("help_features", "Admin Users")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-channels">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Channels")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-server-settings">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Server Settings")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-admin-motd">{dgettext("help_features", "Admin MOTD")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-broadcast">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Broadcast")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-audit-log">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Audit Log")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-admin-turn">{dgettext("help_features", "Admin TURN")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-danger-zone">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Danger Zone")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-admin">{dgettext("help_features", "/admin Command")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-desktop">{dgettext("help_features", "Desktop & Windows")}</.help_link>
</p>
